{
  "_comment": [
    "Movement presets in Source units (u, u/s). The scenario writer multiplies lengths and speeds by MapScale.",
    "shift: 'walk' or 'sprint'. KovaaK's binds Ability 1 to Left Shift by default; the preset puts a",
    "sprint ability there whose SpeedModifier is shift_speed_mult (< 1 walks, > 1 sprints, held, all directions).",
    "Shared with other AimMod services: keep keys stable and add new presets rather than changing meanings.",
    "clamp_air_speed: true caps horizontal speed at the input speed (CS); false allows strafe-jump gains (Quake). variant: the scenario name's variant part.",
    "model: 'ue' = Unreal character movement (KovaaK's own Counter-Striker profile style; the Shift walk/sprint multiplier applies), 'quake' = KovaaK's Quake/Source movement (strafe jumping; the sprint multiplier is not applied by that movement mode)."
  ],
